All the codes used for calculating volume transports in
Karami et al., 2026 (https://esd.copernicus.org/articles/17/1151/2026/) and Navarro-Labastida et al., (in prep).
You could find section definitions in sections_HR.dat, and other examples in Sections/
The provided codes if want to be used have to be modify for the HPC architecture you are about to use. 
This codes works were tested for the HPC FREJA-NSC Linkoping University, Sweden.

